Chapter: LeadingDotContinuation

 A '.field' continuation on its own line was silently dropped, leaving
 the receiver as the whole body and producing a misleading type error.
 CDX1071 rejects it and points at the receiver-on-same-line rule.

Section: Definitions

  Rec = record {
   val : Integer
  }

  get : Rec -> Rec
  get (r) =
    r
    .val

  opening : Rec = get (Rec { val = 9 })

